<!-- Local Boilerplate discovery, verified against bikeshed==7.1.1 source
     (InputSource.FileInputSource.directory()/relative(), used by
     retrieve.retrieveBoilerplateFile() when `Local Boilerplate: header yes`
     is set): Bikeshed looks for header.include next to the .bs SOURCE FILE
     being compiled (os.path.dirname of that file's own path), never
     relative to the CWD `bikeshed` is invoked from -- so each of
     documentation/, mikadiv/, streamld/ needs its own local header.include
     copy sitting beside its .bs file(s). -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
